Z||000004||Shaun41178||06-23-99||01:25 AM||||Greendano: I do race it.  i ahve taken ti to the dragstrip once and have clocked off a best qtr mile of 14.8 at 92 mph.  The temp was about 60 and the pressure was about 30.00 and elevation was around 700 feet or so.<p>I plan on attending a sport compact nationals in Norwalk in July.  It will be mostly imports that will be there so I guess I will have to show them =some domestic power.<p>As of now though my car is no where near ready to go to the nationals.  I still need to add my 2.5 inch exhaust along with 1.6 rockers shift kit and underdrive pulley.  Hopefully with these mods I can turn low 14 second times.  Parts have not been comming in as fast as I would like so i am going to be rushing to ghet my car ready.  If it is not ready then I will take my car with the mods done to it and see how it runs.  We'll see
